OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for 'least impressive
OL,4,Aheist' ram-raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who launched a bungled ram-raid
OL,7,Fattack on a supermarket cash machine
OL,8,Fhalf an hour before its opening time
OL,9,Fhave been jailed.
OL,11,FDean Smith, 33, and Tjay O'Neil, 35,
OL,12,Ffled empty-handed after their attack on
OL,13,Fa Morrisons store in Carlisle at about
OL,14,F06:30 on 15 September.
OL,16,FThey both admitted burglary with intent
OL,17,Fto steal and damaging property, while
OL,18,FSmith also admitted dangerous driving
OL,19,Fand drink-driving.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
