OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for 'least impressive
OL,4,Aheist' ram-raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarlisle Crown Court heard the failed
OL,7,Fburglary was "perhaps a contender for
OL,8,Fthe least impressive heist in criminal
OL,9,Fhistory". Smith was jailed for 33
OL,10,Fmonths and O'Neil for two years.
